    "updated_at": "2024-04-09T10:09:05Z",
    "body": "Thank you @Kaiido, it seems this even can be fired then, in principle. If an event propagates from  a `MessagePort` to a `Worker`, where are the steps for this? In the [message port post message steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-messaging.html#message-port-post-message-steps) only see `MessagePort` as the event target, so is there some general language about how events are propagated here?",
